  "description": "Discontinued, single generation. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic >X<.\n\nYears of production: from 2009\n\nThe Cotic >X< was our steel cyclocross frameset, equally at home racing cross, commuting or mixing road and off-road riding.\n\nIt was zingy, responsive and durable in the way only the best steel frames are, built on the Cotic cornerstones of involving handling, huge tyre clearance and minimised weight. Add a forward thinking disc brake option and practical mudguard eyes, and it made the perfect winter partner-in-grime.",
